        "headline": "A road trip with Bruce Campbell goes somewhere unexpected.",
        "description": "<p>Who doesn't love Bruce Campbell? After decades battling Deadites and stealing scenes, he\u2019s back with something altogether different. This poignant road-trip comedy\u2013written, directed by, and starring Bruce\u2013follows widowed pear salesman Ernie Tyler as he travels across Oregon to fulfill his late wife's very specific wishes for her ashes. Funny, gently offbeat, and full of heart, it's a reminder that Bruce's greatest superpower has never just been fighting monsters. It's telling a good story.</p>",
